<div class="frame">
  <div class="apphead">
    <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.2px;">Advantage</span>
    <span style="width: 1px; height: 16px; background: var(--border-medium);"></span>
    <span class="micro">Matches</span>
    <span class="micro" style="color: var(--ink-300);">/</span>
    <span class="micro" style="color: var(--ink-900);">Ellison vs Duval</span>
    <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
    <span style="display: block; width: 78px; height: 26px; border: 1px solid var(--border-medium); border-radius: 8px;"></span>
    <span style="display: block; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--ink-100);"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="page">
    <!-- The rail is unchanged: identity, one fact group, the derived-match
         caveats pinned to the bottom. The Advantage Intelligence card that used
         to sit here is gone — its summary is now the lede in the pane, and two
         homes for one finding is one too many. -->
    <div class="rail">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Match</span>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
            <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;">M. Ellison</span>
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--viz-good)" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-500); margin: 0 2px;">vs</span>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">R. Duval</span>
          </div>
          <span class="score">6&ndash;4 3&ndash;6 7&ndash;5</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-400)" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 11h18"></path></svg>
          <span class="micro tabular" style="color: var(--ink-700);">Mar 14, 2026</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-400)" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16"></rect><path d="M3 12h18M12 4v16"></path></svg>
          <span class="micro" style="color: var(--ink-700);">Hard</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-400)" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"></path></svg>
          <span class="micro tabular mono" style="color: var(--ink-700);">02:14:38</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-400)" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.5 17.5 3 6V3h3l11.5 11.5M13 19l6-6M16 16l4 4M19 21l2-2"></path></svg>
          <span class="micro tabular" style="color: var(--ink-700);">247 points &middot; 31 games</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--surface-subtle); padding: 11px 12px;">
        <span class="eyebrow-sm">Match data</span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 100%;"></span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 86%;"></span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 54%;"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pane">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding-top: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;">
          <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; padding: 11px 0 9px; box-shadow: inset 0 -2px 0 var(--blue);">Statistics</span>
          <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; padding: 11px 0 9px; color: var(--ink-500);">Shots &amp; placement</span>
          <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; padding: 11px 0 9px; color: var(--ink-500);">Film room</span>
        </div>
        <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 5px;">
          <span style="padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--blue-tint-12); color: var(--blue); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500;">All sets</span>
          <span style="padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--border-medium); color: var(--ink-500); font-size: 10px;">S1</span>
          <span style="padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--border-medium); color: var(--ink-500); font-size: 10px;">S2</span>
          <span style="padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--border-medium); color: var(--ink-500); font-size: 10px;">S3</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- THE LEDE — the finding, then the two figures that carry it. Above the
           KPI strip, because a number only means something once you know which
           question it answers. -->
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start; padding-top: 4px;">
        <div style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 13px; min-width: 0;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l1.9 5.6L19.5 10l-5.6 1.9L12 17.5l-1.9-5.6L4.5 10l5.6-1.4z"></path></svg>
            <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--ink-500);">What decided it</span>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.4px; line-height: 1.3; max-width: 32ch;">You held serve on the T all match &mdash; and lost it in the third when you stopped going there.</div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; max-width: 64ch;">
            <span class="bar" style="width: 96%;"></span>
            <span class="bar" style="width: 88%;"></span>
            <span class="bar" style="width: 44%;"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-shrink: 0;">
          <div class="card" style="width: 168px; gap: 10px; padding: 18px;">
            <span class="eyebrow-sm">Deuce T</span>
            <span class="tabular" style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1; color: var(--blue);">77%</span>
            <span class="micro">won &middot; 27 of 35, all sets</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="width: 168px; gap: 10px; padding: 18px;">
            <span class="eyebrow-sm">Deuce T, set 3</span>
            <span class="tabular" style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1;">2</span>
            <span class="micro">attempts &middot; down from 19</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Evidence: with film on the match, the proof is the clips themselves.
           The Film room tab still exists — this is the shortcut into it. -->
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px;">
          <span class="eyebrow">The evidence</span>
          <span class="micro">4 points</span>
          <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
          <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--blue);">Open in Film room</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px;">
          <div class="card" style="padding: 0; overflow: hidden; gap: 0;"><span style="display: block; height: 88px; background: var(--ink-100);"></span><span style="display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 12px;"><span class="micro mono tabular">0:38:11</span><span class="micro">&middot; S1 5&ndash;4, 30&ndash;15</span></span></div>
          <div class="card" style="padding: 0; overflow: hidden; gap: 0;"><span style="display: block; height: 88px; background: var(--ink-100);"></span><span style="display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 12px;"><span class="micro mono tabular">1:12:46</span><span class="micro">&middot; S2 2&ndash;3, 40&ndash;30</span></span></div>
          <div class="card" style="padding: 0; overflow: hidden; gap: 0;"><span style="display: block; height: 88px; background: var(--ink-100);"></span><span style="display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 12px;"><span class="micro mono tabular">1:38:02</span><span class="micro">&middot; S3 3&ndash;3, deuce</span></span></div>
          <div class="card" style="padding: 0; overflow: hidden; gap: 0;"><span style="display: block; height: 88px; background: var(--ink-100);"></span><span style="display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 12px;"><span class="micro mono tabular">1:47:05</span><span class="micro">&middot; S3 5&ndash;5, 15&ndash;30</span></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="height: 1px; background: var(--border-hairline);"></div>

      <div class="card" style="flex-direction: row; padding: 0; overflow: hidden;">
        <div style="flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; padding: 20px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);">
          <span class="eyebrow-sm">First serve in</span>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 10px;">
            <span class="tabular" style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1;">64%</span>
            <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
            <svg width="80" height="28" viewBox="0 0 80 28" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="2,20 18,16 34,18 50,10 66,12 78,6" fill="none" stroke="#5DB955" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></polyline></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="micro" style="color: var(--viz-good);">+4 <span style="color: var(--ink-500);">vs your avg 60%</span></span>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; padding: 20px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);">
          <span class="eyebrow-sm">First serve points won</span>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 10px;">
            <span class="tabular" style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1;">71%</span>
            <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
            <svg width="80" height="28" viewBox="0 0 80 28" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="2,10 18,14 34,9 50,15 66,12 78,8" fill="none" stroke="#5DB955" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></polyline></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="micro" style="color: var(--viz-good);">+2 <span style="color: var(--ink-500);">vs your avg 69%</span></span>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; padding: 20px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);">
          <span class="eyebrow-sm">Second serve points won</span>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 10px;">
            <span class="tabular" style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1; color: var(--ink-500);">&mdash;</span>
          </div>
          <span class="micro">Not measured</span>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; padding: 20px;">
          <span class="eyebrow-sm">Break points saved</span>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 10px;">
            <span class="tabular" style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1;">57%</span>
            <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
            <svg width="80" height="28" viewBox="0 0 80 28" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="2,8 18,12 34,11 50,18 66,16 78,21" fill="none" stroke="#E51837" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></polyline></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="micro" style="color: var(--error-strong);">&minus;9 <span style="color: var(--ink-500);">vs your avg 66%</span></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Two-column grid: head-to-head beside the three point-derived charts -->
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; flex-grow: 1; min-height: 0;">
        <div class="card" style="gap: 0;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px;">
            <span class="eyebrow">Head to head</span>
            <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
            <span class="micro tabular">247 points</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline); padding-bottom: 8px;">
            <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
            <span style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;">Ellison</span>
            <span style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-600);">Duval</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div style="padding: 13px 0 5px;"><span class="eyebrow-sm">Serve</span></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0;"><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-700);">Aces</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px;">7</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">4</span></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0;"><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-700);">Double faults</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px;">3</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">6</span></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0;"><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-700);">First serve in</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px;">64%</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">58%</span></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0;"><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-700);">First serve points won</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px;">71%</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">63%</span></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0;"><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-700);">Break points saved</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px;">57%</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">40%</span></div>
            <div style="padding: 13px 0 5px;"><span class="eyebrow-sm">Return</span></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0;"><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-700);">First serve returns won</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px;">37%</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">29%</span></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0;"><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-700);">Return winners</span><span style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-500);">&mdash;</span><span style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-500);">&mdash;</span></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0;"><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-700);">Break points converted</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px;">60%</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">43%</span></div>
            <div style="padding: 13px 0 5px;"><span class="eyebrow-sm">Points</span></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0;"><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-700);">Winners</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px;">28</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">22</span></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0;"><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-700);">Unforced errors</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px;">31</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">39</span></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0;"><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-700);">Total points won</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px;">128</span><span class="tabular" style="width: 96px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">119</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; min-height: 0;">
          <div class="card" style="gap: 12px; flex: 1;">
            <span class="eyebrow">Performance tracker</span>
            <div style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 6px; min-height: 92px;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 560 110" width="100%" height="110" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <line x1="0" y1="55" x2="560" y2="55" stroke="var(--ink-100)" stroke-width="1"></line>
                <polyline points="0,72 60,64 120,70 180,48 240,58 300,40 360,52 420,34 480,44 560,26" fill="none" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline>
                <polyline points="0,60 60,66 120,58 180,74 240,68 300,80 360,72 420,86 480,78 560,90" fill="none" stroke="var(--player-2)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 3"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 14px;"><span class="micro"><span style="display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 2px; background: var(--blue); vertical-align: middle;"></span> Ellison</span><span class="micro"><span style="display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 2px; background: var(--player-2); vertical-align: middle;"></span> Duval</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="gap: 12px; flex: 1;">
            <span class="eyebrow">Rally length</span>
            <div style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 8px; min-height: 78px;">
              <span style="flex: 1; height: 62%; background: var(--blue); border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;"></span>
              <span style="flex: 1; height: 88%; background: var(--blue); border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;"></span>
              <span style="flex: 1; height: 46%; background: var(--blue); border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;"></span>
              <span style="flex: 1; height: 30%; background: var(--blue); border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;"></span>
              <span style="flex: 1; height: 18%; background: var(--blue); border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;"></span>
              <span style="flex: 1; height: 10%; background: var(--blue); border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;"></span>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;"><span class="micro tabular">1&ndash;3</span><span class="micro tabular">4&ndash;6</span><span class="micro tabular">7&ndash;9</span><span class="micro tabular">10&ndash;12</span><span class="micro tabular">13&ndash;15</span><span class="micro tabular">16+</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="gap: 12px; flex: 1;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline;"><span class="eyebrow">How points ended</span><span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span><span class="micro tabular">128 points won</span></div>
            <div style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;">
              <svg width="96" height="96" viewBox="0 0 96 96" aria-hidden="true">
                <circle cx="48" cy="48" r="36" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-100)" stroke-width="16"></circle>
                <circle cx="48" cy="48" r="36" fill="none" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width="16" stroke-dasharray="49 177" transform="rotate(-90 48 48)"></circle>
                <circle cx="48" cy="48" r="36" fill="none" stroke="var(--player-2)" stroke-width="16" stroke-dasharray="55 171" transform="rotate(-11 48 48)"></circle>
              </svg>
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; flex-grow: 1;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--blue);"></span><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-700);">Winners</span><span class="tabular" style="font-size: 12px;">28</span></div>
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--player-2);"></span><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-700);">Unforced errors</span><span class="tabular" style="font-size: 12px;">31</span></div>
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--ink-200);"></span><span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-700);">Forced errors</span><span class="tabular" style="font-size: 12px;">69</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cap">
    <h3>Match report &mdash; Statistics, film attached</h3>
    <p>Direction A folded into the page you already have: the rail and the three destinations stay exactly as they are, and the lede is added at the top of the Statistics pane. The finding leads, the two figures that carry it sit beside it, and the clips that prove it sit under it &mdash; then the KPI strip and the full comparison continue unchanged below. The rail&rsquo;s Advantage Intelligence card is retired into the lede rather than duplicated.</p>
    <p class="trade"><strong>Depends on:</strong> every match producing a usable insight. When one is thin, the lede has to degrade to the headline figure alone rather than print a weak sentence.</p>
  </div>
</div>
